This is the TV I adore.
It has an MES console connected to it with one gamepad.
I bend down to the TV stand and open the door.
[background scene="res://scenes/dialogues/DialogicBackgroundScene.tscn" arg="res://assets/images/debugApartment.jpeg" fade="0.5" wait="true"]
This is where my treasures are kept.
- Take out all cartridges
	if {mcRoom.isCartridgeInTVStand} == true:
